## Why This Is Asked

This evaluates the ability to design a plugin-friendly, runtime-extensible load balancing system for edge proxies, focusing on decoupling and safe dynamic strategy selection.

## Key Concepts

- Strategy pattern for algorithm abstraction
- Registry-based plugin architecture
- Runtime extensibility without core modifications
